            <span class="ms-photo-num">01 / A BETTER CLIENT JOURNEY</span>
            <strong>From first interest<br/>to booked consultation.</strong>
            <span class="ms-photo-small">ADVERTISE &nbsp;→&nbsp; RESPOND &nbsp;→&nbsp; BOOK</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ms-photo-float"><span class="ms-float-circle" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><strong>Inquiry received</strong><span>Next step: front-desk follow-up</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ms-ticker" aria-label="Med spa marketing and automation services">
      <div class="ms-ticker-label">THE CONNECTED GROWTH SYSTEM <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
