    <section class="ms-intro ms-shell">
      <p class="ms-kicker">THE OPPORTUNITY</p>
      <div><h2>Interest is only useful when your team can <em>turn it into a conversation.</em></h2><p>Med spa owners don't need more disconnected marketing tools. They need qualified consultations, a responsive front desk and clear visibility into what happens after someone submits a form or makes a call.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="ms-treatment" id="treatments" aria-labelledby="ms-treatment-title">
      <div class="ms-shell">
        <div class="ms-treatment-top">
          <div><p class="ms-kicker">DESIGNED AROUND YOUR PRACTICE</p><h2 id="ms-treatment-title">Marketing that feels as considered<br/>as the care you deliver.</h2></div>
          <p>Different services attract different clients. We adapt the campaigns, creative, qualification questions and booking journey to your practice—not the other way around.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-treatment-layout">
          <div class="ms-treatment-visual">
            <img id="ms-treatment-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512290923902-8a9f81dc236c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Skincare and facial service illustration" loading="lazy" width="900" height="850" />
            <div class="ms-treatment-img-label"><small id="ms-treatment-count">01 / 03</small><strong id="ms-treatment-visual-label">Skin &amp; facial services</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ms-treatment-select" role="group" aria-label="Explore med spa marketing examples">
            <button type="button" class="ms-treatment-choice is-active" data-treat="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01 / SKIN</span><strong>Facials &amp; skin services</strong><small>Service-led campaigns, consultation questions and repeat-visit pathways.</small><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button>
            <button type="button" class="ms-treatment-choice" data-treat="1" aria-pressed="false"><span>02 / AESTHETICS</span><strong>Aesthetic consultations</strong><small>Trust-first creative and clear handoff to licensed medical staff.</small><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button>
            <button type="button" class="ms-treatment-choice" data-treat="2" aria-pressed="false"><span>03 / RETENTION</span><strong>Follow-up &amp; rebooking</strong><small>Prompt responses, consent-based reminders and a more connected client experience.</small><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button>
            <p class="ms-treatment-note">Illustrative service journeys—not claims about treatment outcomes or patient results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="ms-system" id="approach"><div class="ms-shell"><div class="ms-section-head"><div><p class="ms-kicker">THE ACQUISITION SYSTEM</p><h2>From first impression<br/>to first consultation.</h2></div><p>Built around your services, team capacity and the real booking journey.</p></div><div class="ms-steps">{services.map(item=><article class="ms-step"><span class="ms-step-num">{item.num} / {item.name}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.desc}</p><span class="ms-step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>)}</div></div></section>

    <!-- MS_POLISH_V3: Separate visual contexts, not repeated treatment photography. -->
