      <div class="ms-shell">
        <div class="ms-gallery-heading">
          <div><p class="ms-kicker">EVERY TOUCHPOINT COUNTS</p>
          <h2 id="ms-gallery-heading">From first impression to a welcoming front desk.</h2></div>
          <p>A strong med spa brand connects the first ad with the consultation, the reception experience and the next appointment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-gallery-grid">
          <figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560066984-138dadb4c035?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Beauty and spa reception environment" loading="lazy" width="700" height="850"/><figcaption><span>01 / FIRST IMPRESSION</span><strong>Reception &amp; arrival</strong></figcaption></figure>
