          <figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Modern clinical and professional service environment" loading="lazy" width="700" height="850"/><figcaption><span>03 / FOLLOW-THROUGH</span><strong>Practice &amp; front desk</strong></figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="ms-ai" id="ai-front-desk"><div class="ms-shell ms-ai-grid"><div><p class="ms-kicker">THE AI FRONT DESK</p><h2>When the phone rings,<br/><em>the journey continues.</em></h2><p>Routine calls, questions and booking requests shouldn't disappear because the front desk is busy. AI can support the team without pretending to be a clinician.</p><ul class="ms-benefits"><li><strong>AI receptionist</strong><span>Inbound call handling, hours, consultation requests and staff handoff.</span></li><li><strong>Website AI chatbot</strong><span>Answers to approved FAQs, new inquiry capture and booking guidance.</span></li><li><strong>Outbound AI calls</strong><span>Consent-based follow-up and appointment coordination, with identification and opt-out safeguards.</span></li><li><strong>CRM & follow-through</strong><span>Routing, reminders, attribution and human escalation.</span></li></ul></div><div class="ms-demo"><div class="ms-demo-bar"><span><i></i> DEMONSTRATION ONLY</span><span>AI FRONT DESK</span></div><div class="ms-demo-body"><div class="ms-chat ms-chat-visitor">Hi, I'd like to book a consultation. Do you have appointments this week?</div><div class="ms-chat ms-chat-ai" id="ms-ai-reply">Hello! I can help with general scheduling information. Which location are you interested in?</div><div class="ms-demo-choices"><button type="button" data-reply="location">Choose a location</button><button type="button" data-reply="staff">Speak with staff</button><button type="button" data-reply="call">How do AI calls work?</button></div></div><div class="ms-demo-foot"><span class="ms-status-dot"></span> Interactive sample — no patient data collected</div></div></div></section>
    <section class="ms-qual ms-shell"><div><p class="ms-kicker">DESIGNED FOR THE RIGHT FIT</p><h2>Your service mix changes<br/>the marketing strategy.</h2></div><div class="ms-qual-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Service-specific campaigns</h3><p>Different offers and consultation journeys for aesthetic services, subject to applicable advertising rules.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Consultation-first qualification</h3><p>Ask useful scheduling and service-interest questions. Keep clinical assessments with qualified providers.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Capacity-aware automation</h3><p>Route inquiries according to locations, calendars, appointment types and staff availability.</p></article></div></section>

    <section class="ms-editorial" aria-label="Front desk experience and marketing support">
      <div class="ms-editorial-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515377905703-c4788e51af15?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Close-up of a skincare oil being applied during a wellness service" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="720" /></div>
      <div class="ms-editorial-content"><p class="ms-kicker">MORE THAN AN AD CAMPAIGN</p><h2>Good marketing creates interest.<br/><em>A better system follows through.</em></h2><p>Ads, landing pages, conversations, qualification, and scheduling should feel like one experience. Our AI workflows support your team with approved information—not diagnosis or treatment recommendations.</p><a href="#ai-front-desk">See the AI front desk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="ms-calc" id="calculator"><div class="ms-shell ms-calc-grid"><div><p class="ms-kicker">THE REVENUE MODEL</p><h2>What could a stronger booking process mean?</h2><p>Use your own assumptions to explore the effect of converting more inquiries into completed consultations. This is a planning calculator, not a forecast or guarantee.</p></div><div class="ms-calc-card"><label for="ms-inquiries">Monthly inquiries <strong id="ms-inquiries-value">100</strong></label><input id="ms-inquiries" type="range" min="20" max="500" value="100" step="10"/><label for="ms-booking">Consultations booked <strong id="ms-booking-value">35%</strong></label><input id="ms-booking" type="range" min="5" max="90" value="35" step="5"/><label for="ms-show">Consultation show rate <strong id="ms-show-value">75%</strong></label><input id="ms-show" type="range" min="20" max="100" value="75" step="5"/><label for="ms-value">Average realized revenue per completed consultation <strong id="ms-value-value">$400</strong></label><input id="ms-value" type="range" min="50" max="2500" value="400" step="50"/><div class="ms-calc-result"><span>Illustrative monthly revenue from completed consultations</span><strong id="ms-result">$10,500</strong><small>Excludes ad spend, operating costs and cancellations after attendance; not a profit estimate.</small></div></div></div></section>

