</section>

<section class="ms-faq ms-shell" id="faq"><div class="ms-section-head"><div><p class="ms-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Clear answers.<br/>No inflated promises.</h2></div></div><div class="ms-faq-list">{faqs.map(item=><details><summary>{item.q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{item.a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
    <section class="ms-final"><div class="ms-shell"><p class="ms-kicker">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>A better front desk starts<br/>before the phone rings.</h2><p>Let's examine your acquisition, booking and follow-up process and find the gaps worth fixing.</p><a class="ms-btn ms-btn-light" href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a strategy call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
